      "writtenOn": "2020-03-11T12:26:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Convenience.\n\nIn order to ensure that the generated Android.bp file is valid it is processed in CheckSnapshot() below in the same way as this input is processed. A reference to a module that is not an sdk member is passed straight through to the snapshot\u0027s Android.bp file and so in order for that Android.bp file to be valid the passed through module must be in the default set of modules that are provided for this test. That includes \"libc\" and \"libm\".\n\nThe \"libc\" module is used in shared_libs just to make sure that the shared_libs property is processed correctly. The \"libm\" module is use in system_shared_libs for the same purpose. It avoids having to create special modules in the default set just for this test.",
      "parentUuid": "b6a50de1_5c461249",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 643,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 643,
        "endChar": 12
